efused, following the card's general rule.\n\nTwo items are recorded in `unresolved`:\n- **Missing date parts:** the card says to ask the customer for missing parts of a date. The schema has no value for that, so the field stays at its default.\n- **Effective date:** the final email takes effect on 14 October (today is 11 October). I applied it anyway, as the email says to. The documents don't say which rules apply to calls before then."}
